Third-party notices for the EverParakeet Swift runtime
=======================================================

Parts of the Swift runtime in this folder are adapted from Apple's Core AI
speech sample code (CoreAISpeech, in Apple's coreai-models repository), which
is distributed under the licence below.

Three files are adapted from Apple's code and are licensed in full under the BSD
3-clause licence below, with the header "Portions Copyright 2026 Apple Inc.
Modifications Copyright 2026 Everpaper.":

  Sources/EverParakeetKit/MelFrontEnd.swift
      Log-mel front end. Adapted from CoreAISpeech.MelSpectrogram
      (Sources/CoreAISpeech/MelSpectrogram.swift).
  Sources/EverParakeetCoreAI/CoreAIEncoder.swift
      The functions flattenAsFloat and flattenNDArray are adapted from
      CoreAIShared/Runtime/NDArray+Helpers.swift, and the NDArray input set-up
      follows Apple's usage pattern.
  Sources/EverParakeetKit/AudioLoader.swift
      The chunked audio file reader is adapted from
      MelSpectrogram.readAllSamples (Sources/CoreAISpeech/MelSpectrogram.swift).

All of these come from Apple's coreai-models repository. Each file carries the
notice in its header. The rest of the Swift runtime is original Everpaper code
under CC-BY-4.0 (see ../NOTICE).

